    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a MORE UPCOMING GAMES! \ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.poster.avif?t=1754124648\" width=800 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.webm?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.poster.avif?t=1754124648\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.webm?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.mp4?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hi, welcome back to our experimental hidden cat project! Cats Around Us is a series that blends heartwarming silent comics with hidden cat gameplay.<br><br>The second installment in the series is called Black Cat.<br><br>Created by Apit No Baka, Black Cat is a five-page silent comic that tells the touching story of a man and his elusive black cat who loves hiding in the shadows. Each page is filled with hidden cats waiting to be discovered as you follow the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/d165b811af9e6e52b948dceb713930ad.poster.avif?t=1754124648\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/d165b811af9e6e52b948dceb713930ad.webm?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/d165b811af9e6e52b948dceb713930ad.mp4?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae 5 pages comic and jigsaw Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3b 200++ cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf7 Photo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd06 Brightness setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Choose your favorite color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 4 Musics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd14 Free hints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Save system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd09 Cute cat sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Gamepad compatible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.poster.avif?t=1754124648\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.webm?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.mp4?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.poster.avif?t=1754124648\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.webm?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.mp4?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/4384b063286becaf5e54526f9b508999.avif?t=1754124648\" width=616 height=91 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.poster.avif?t=1754124648\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.webm?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.mp4?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hi, welcome back to our experimental hidden cat project! Cats Around Us is a series that blends heartwarming silent comics with hidden cat gameplay.<br><br>The second installment in the series is called Black Cat.<br><br>Created by Apit No Baka, Black Cat is a five-page silent comic that tells the touching story of a man and his elusive black cat who loves hiding in the shadows. Each page is filled with hidden cats waiting to be discovered as you follow the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/d165b811af9e6e52b948dceb713930ad.poster.avif?t=1754124648\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/d165b811af9e6e52b948dceb713930ad.webm?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/d165b811af9e6e52b948dceb713930ad.mp4?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae 5 pages comic and jigsaw Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3b 200++ cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf7 Photo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd06 Brightness setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Choose your favorite color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 4 Musics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd14 Free hints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Save system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd09 Cute cat sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Gamepad compatible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.poster.avif?t=1754124648\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.webm?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.mp4?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.poster.avif?t=1754124648\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.webm?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.mp4?t=1754124648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src